      "orig": "We are explicitly not just looking at the accuracy number. A candidate scoring 75% with sharp self-critique and clear reasoning is more interesting to us than one scoring 95% with no reflection. We've seeded a few benchmarks that are genuinely debatable - we want to see if you spot them and argue back. Building agents that work in production means knowing when the spec is wrong.",
